<p>Feel free to connect with me on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/niha-pereira/">Linkedin</a>, <a href="https://github.com/nnpereira">Github</a>, or <a href="https://bsky.app/profile/nnpereira.bsky.social">BlueSky</a>.</p>

